WEBVTT

00:01:57.876 --> 00:02:01.316
that when underrepresented people
take over a business,

00:02:01.356 --> 00:02:03.596
that business seems to start to fail.

00:02:04.476 --> 00:02:06.076
And that's really strange,

00:02:06.076 --> 00:02:08.676
and if that's true,
that's worth looking into.

00:02:09.596 --> 00:02:12.716
And so "The Times" newspaper
did look into it.

00:02:12.716 --> 00:02:14.916
And they released an article
with the headline,

00:02:14.956 --> 00:02:17.876
"Women on the Board:
A Help or a Hindrance?"

00:02:18.796 --> 00:02:20.636
And they said what I've just told you,

00:02:20.636 --> 00:02:24.356
that when women take over businesses
at those most senior levels --

00:02:24.356 --> 00:02:26.316
board member, CEO --

00:02:26.356 --> 00:02:29.676
that those businesses seem to find
themselves in a moment of trouble.